+        // the walkmesh re-projection's float noise (an emulation's worst: 0.18u at +-30000, see BeginTurn), for a
+        // true turn in place; anything more is the engine's push-out or edge force, a human's stick, or a script.
+        // The end values are null when he is off a field or the controlled actor or field id is no longer the
+        // one the turn began on.
+        private void EndTurn(String why, Int32 frames)
